ylic"},{"text":"Elastane"},{"text":"Fibre blends"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fibre length"},{"text":"Fineness"},{"text":"Strength"},{"text":"Elongation"},{"text":"Moisture regain"},{"text":"Crimp"},{"text":"Maturity"},{"text":"Micronaire"},{"text":"Uniformity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Quality problems often originate at the raw-material stage, so a quality professional must understand how fibre properties affect downstream processing."}]},{"heading":"Yarn quality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yarn count"},{"text":"Yarn twist"},{"text":"Yarn strength"},{"text":"Elongation"},{"text":"Unevenness"},{"text":"Hairiness"},{"text":"Imperfections"},{"text":"Neps"},{"text":"Thick places"},{"text":"Thin places"},{"text":"CV%"},{"text":"Yarn appearance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how spinning parameters influence yarn quality."}]},{"heading":"Fabric quality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Woven fabric"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ends and picks"},{"text":"GSM"},{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"Cover factor"},{"text":"Tensile strength"},{"text":"Tear strength"},{"text":"Abrasion"},{"text":"Seam performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Knitted fabric"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loop structure"},{"text":"GSM"},{"text":"Stretch"},{"text":"Recovery"},{"text":"Spirality"},{"text":"Bursting strength"},{"text":"Dimensional stability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fabric appearance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shade variation"},{"text":"Stains"},{"text":"Holes"},{"text":"Slubs"},{"text":"Barre"},{"text":"Creases"},{"text":"Missing yarn"},{"text":"Weaving defects"},{"text":"Knitting defects"}]}]},{"heading":"Textile testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical testing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GSM"},{"text":"Thickness"},{"text":"Tensile strength"},{"text":"Tear strength"},{"text":"Bursting strength"},{"text":"Abrasion resistance"},{"text":"Pilling"},{"text":"Dimensional stability"},{"text":"Shrinkage"},{"text":"Stretch and recovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Colour testing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Colour fastness to washing"},{"text":"Colour fastness to rubbing"},{"text":"Colour fastness to perspiration"},{"text":"Light fastness"},{"text":"Shade matching"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chemical testing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pH"},{"text":"Formaldehyde where applicable"},{"text":"Restricted substances"},{"text":"Fibre composition"},{"text":"Chemical residues"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Testing requirements depend on product, buyer, market and applicable standards."}]},{"heading":"Garment quality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the student moves into apparel, learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Measurement accuracy"},{"text":"Stitch quality"},{"text":"Seam strength"},{"text":"Seam allowance"},{"text":"Stitch density"},{"text":"Shade matching"},{"text":"Defect classification"},{"text":"Garment appearance"},{"text":"Trims and accessories"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Final inspection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fabric inspection","Cutting","Sewing","Finishing","Final inspection","Packing"]}]},{"heading":"Statistical Process Control","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SPC is extremely important."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Process variation"},{"text":"Control limits"},{"text":"Cp"},{"text":"Cpk"},{"text":"Pp"},{"text":"Ppk"},{"text":"X-bar charts"},{"text":"R charts"},{"text":"S charts"},{"text":"p charts"},{"text":"np charts"},{"text":"c charts"},{"text":"u charts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to identify whether a process is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Stable","Drifting","Out of control"]},{"type":"p","text":"before defects reach the customer."}]},{"heading":"Quality tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pareto analysis"},{"text":"Fishbone diagram"},{"text":"5 Whys"},{"text":"Check sheets"},{"text":"Histogram"},{"text":"Scatter plots"},{"text":"Control charts"},{"text":"Process flowcharts"},{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"8D"},{"text":"CAPA"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Corrective action"},{"text":"Preventive action"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Quality Controller should not simply detect defects."},{"type":"p","text":"They should identify:"},{"type":"p","text":"Why the defect occurred and how to prevent recurrence."}]},{"heading":"Quality-management systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quality policy"},{"text":"Quality objectives"},{"text":"SOPs"},{"text":"Work instructions"},{"text":"Inspection plans"},{"text":"Sampling plans"},{"text":"Non-conformance reports"},{"text":"CAPA"},{"text":"Internal audits"},{"text":"Supplier quality"},{"text":"Document control"},{"text":"Traceability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ISO 9001"},{"text":"Textile-specific standards"},{"text":"Buyer quality manuals"},{"text":"Product specifications"},{"text":"Testing protocols"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use the current standards from the relevant standards organisation before applying them professionally."},{"type":"p","text":"ISO","url":"https://www.iso.org/"}]},{"heading":"Sampling and inspection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sampling concepts"},{"text":"AQL"},{"text":"Inspection levels"},{"text":"Lot acceptance"},{"text":"Defect classification"},{"text":"Critical defects"},{"text":"Major defects"},{"text":"Minor defects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that the sampling plan must match the product, customer specification and applicable standard."}]},{"heading":"Digital quality analytics","kind":"other","blocks":